+ * reconnect/poll storm fired one refresh per booting instance for the SAME
+ * project (16-20 concurrent/min in prod, RSS ~19.6 GB, HTTP wedge). This map
+ * lives at module scope — shared across every Service instance in the serve
+ * process — so concurrent refreshes for one projectID coalesce onto a single
+ * in-flight run; the entry is removed when that run settles.
